# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Checkpoints of a Python simulation (D223) on the GPU in
# double precision, scenario stages of Inputs/python_checkpoints.py.
# The same run against a changed stage from a checkpoint of `mdir run`:
# refusals that name the changed entries (restraints, temperature,
# barostat, electrostatics, masses), another integrator, another
# precision, and stages of other physics against `mdir run` from
# `[input] checkpoint`.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_checkpoints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU Double mdir %t stages | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: a stage of the same physics GPU Double
# CHECK: a stage restrained against mdir run GPU Double
# CHECK: a leapfrog stage against mdir run GPU Double
# CHECK: checkpoints stages GPU Double passed
